    """
    Fold [item, signed quantity] transactions into a JSON object of net quantities.

    - x is read from record['record_2'] as a list of [item, signed_quantity] pairs.
    - Product codes are case-sensitive and used exactly as scanned.
    - The result represents the physical inventory (net quantity) per product.
